msgctxt "476"
msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Salir"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "481"
msgid "Cancel the order."
msgstr "Cancelar el pedido."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "499"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Pagar"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "505"
msgid "Order the currently selected item.  "
msgstr "Pedir el objeto actualmente seleccionado.  "

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=dani64amv
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "542"
msgid "(I haven't picked anything.)  "
msgstr "(No he escogido nada)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=dani64amv
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "573"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)  "
msgstr "(Me hace falta dinero)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "596"
msgid "Thank you. That'll be %s."
msgstr "Gracias. Eso sería %s."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "622"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr "(No puedo llevar más cosas)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "654"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr "(Están agotados)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "674"
msgid "A one-stop hangover cure. It's full of natural\ningredients like turmeric."
msgstr "Una cura para la resaca todo en uno. Está\nlleno de ingredientes naturales como la\ncúrcuma."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "748"
msgid "Should help you get back on your feet when you're\nlow on health and Heat."
msgstr "Esto debería ayudarte a recuperarte cuando tengas\npoca salud y Heat."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "822"
msgid "More effective at revitalizing your health and Heat\nthan a regular Staminan X."
msgstr "Más efectivo para revitalizar tu salud y Heat que\nel Staminan normal."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "901"
msgid "One of the most potent energy drinks on the market.\nIt'll dramatically restore your health and Heat."
msgstr "Uno de los energizantes más potentes en el mercado.\nRestaurará dramáticamente tu salud y Heat."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1002"
msgid "This should help increase your Heat when you're\nfeeling down."
msgstr "Esto debería aumentar tu Heat cuando estés desanimado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1064"
msgid "This will give you a bigger Heat boost than the regular\nTauriner."
msgstr "Esto te dará un aumento de Heat mayor que el Tauriner \nhabitual."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1130"
msgid "This thing is no joke. It'll significantly boost your Heat."
msgstr "Esta cosa no es broma. Aumentará significativamente tu Heat."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1190"
msgid "Has all the nutrients you need to restore your health."
msgstr "Contiene todos los nutrientes que necesitas para\nrestaurar tu salud."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1245"
msgid "Packed with even more nutrients for a larger health\nboost."
msgstr "Repleto de aún más nutrientes para obtener un\naumento de salud mayor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1304"
msgid "Really lives up to its name. It's got enough nutrients\nand supplements to revive an elephant."
msgstr "Realmente hace honor a su nombre. Tiene suficientes\nnutrientes y suplementos como para revivir a un elefante."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1398"
msgid "Excuse me, sir. You don't look like someone who\nneeds contact lenses."
msgstr "Disculpe, señor. No te ves como alguien que\nnecesita lentes de contacto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1468"
msgid "Useful for patching yourself up. Are you injured, sir?"
msgstr "Útil para curarte. ¿Está herido, señor?"

